Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?perf(render):=20dirty-slot=20list=20for=20fence?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20pack=20(~2.0=C3=97)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

When dirtyCount > 0, packPresentationWorldToFence rewrites only the dense
dirtySlots list instead of scanning every active slot's dirty mask after
copyDenseFrom. presentationWorld maintains dirtySlots/dirtyPositions alongside
dirtyCount. Bench toggle restores the O(active) walk.
---
